    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495840/extras/760c644cf77ec3ed028d3dc58ace1489.avif?t=1749490286\" width=600 height=198 /></span><strong><i>ShopFront</i></strong> is a fast paced top down twin stick action arcade-like game set in a fantasy world full of heroes thirsty for more <strong><i>Gems</i></strong> to line their pockets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong><i>Keeper</i></strong>, an elderly shop keeper with a poor temper fed up with all the heroes destroying his pottery and decides to take matters into his own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495840/extras/ad83d3777c0c4ee48f939a37d75bdf1e.poster.avif?t=1749490286\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495840/extras/ad83d3777c0c4ee48f939a37d75bdf1e.webm?t=1749490286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Defeat</strong></i> thousands of Heroes with your broom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Destroy</strong></i> 4+ Bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Explore</strong></i><strong> </strong>3+ Areas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Collect</strong></i> Gems and go <i><strong>GEMHIGH</strong></i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495840/extras/c483f96507de480ac684747aa8ed4b68.poster.avif?t=1749490286\" width=600 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495840/extras/c483f96507de480ac684747aa8ed4b68.webm?t=1749490286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>PROTECT. YOUR.</strong> <strong>POT</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495840/extras/760c644cf77ec3ed028d3dc58ace1489.avif?t=1749490286\" width=600 height=198 /></span><strong><i>ShopFront</i></strong> is a fast paced top down twin stick action arcade-like game set in a fantasy world full of heroes thirsty for more <strong><i>Gems</i></strong> to line their pockets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong><i>Keeper</i></strong>, an elderly shop keeper with a poor temper fed up with all the heroes destroying his pottery and decides to take matters into his own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495840/extras/ad83d3777c0c4ee48f939a37d75bdf1e.poster.avif?t=1749490286\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495840/extras/ad83d3777c0c4ee48f939a37d75bdf1e.webm?t=1749490286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Defeat</strong></i> thousands of Heroes with your broom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Destroy</strong></i> 4+ Bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Explore</strong></i><strong> </strong>3+ Areas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Collect</strong></i> Gems and go <i><strong>GEMHIGH</strong></i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495840/extras/c483f96507de480ac684747aa8ed4b68.poster.avif?t=1749490286\" width=600 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495840/extras/c483f96507de480ac684747aa8ed4b68.webm?t=1749490286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>PROTECT. YOUR.</strong> <strong>POT</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
